# GeoIP database baked into the cdn-node image (client region for usage
# metering): DB-IP Lite Country, MaxMind DB format, CC BY 4.0
# (https://db-ip.com, attribution in packer/cdn-node/openresty/README.md and
# /opt/hippius-cdn/geoip/NOTICE in the image).
#
# fetch-geoip.sh downloads the file when the tenant-baker image is built:
# our mirror first, then DB-IP; whichever answers is checked against the
# same SHA256 (of the .mmdb.gz as DB-IP publishes it) before it is unpacked.
# Nothing is downloaded at bake time or on a node.
#
# Monthly bump (the trigger of the cdn-node refresh):
#   1. download dbip-country-lite-YYYY-MM.mmdb.gz from DB-IP;
#   2. sha256sum it;
#   3. upload it unchanged, PUBLIC:
#        aws s3 cp <file> s3://hippius-compute-images/geoip/ --acl public-read
#      (without --acl public-read the object is private: anonymous 403, and
#      the build silently falls back to DB-IP until DB-IP drops the month);
#   4. curl the mirror URL anonymously and check the sha256 again;
#   5. set MONTH, both URLs and SHA256 here; merge; pin the rebuilt
#      tenant-baker image; re-bake cdn-node.
# DB-IP itself serves only the current and the previous month: the mirror
# is what keeps an older pin buildable. cdn-geoip-freshness.yml warns once
# the pin is more than a month old.
DBIP_COUNTRY_LITE_MONTH=2026-10
DBIP_COUNTRY_LITE_MIRROR_URL=https://s3.hippius.com/hippius-compute-images/geoip/dbip-country-lite-2026-10.mmdb.gz
DBIP_COUNTRY_LITE_URL=https://download.db-ip.com/free/dbip-country-lite-2026-10.mmdb.gz
DBIP_COUNTRY_LITE_SHA256=4cd44536ddfd40fec7eca94a233f7d19f38d470e6522e653cb8d27001f5fe177
